" Entry point for neovim (see nvim/init.lua): general settings only. Key
" rebinds live in nvim/keybinds.lua. Formatting is handled by
" nvim/conform.lua instead of vim/formatters.vim, and vim/vim.vim's Plugins
" section is vim-plug, which neovim doesn't use (vim-highlightedyank and
" vim-commentary are built in, see nvim/init.lua).
source ~/dotfiles/vim/settings.vim
